  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ヘイチョーと　よばれる　１ぴきと\nヘイと　よばれる　５ひきで　ひとつ。\nヘイチョーの　めいれいは　ぜったい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "리더라고 불리는 1마리와\n멤버라고 불리는 5마리로 이루어져 있다.\n리더의 명령은 절대적이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "列陣兵由１個頭頭\n和５個跟班組成。\n頭頭的命令不可違抗。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "C’est une entité unique composée d’un chef\net de cinq cadets. Ces derniers obéissent\nsans sourciller à leur supérieur hiérarchique.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dieses Pokémon besteht aus fünf Untergebenen\nund einem Anführer. Die Befehle des Anführers\nwerden nie in Frage gestellt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Este Pokémon consta de cinco subalternos y un\nlíder, cuyas órdenes obedecen sin rechistar.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Questo Pokémon è formato da un capo e da\ncinque sottoposti che obbediscono ciecamente\nai suoi ordini.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Five of them are troopers, and one is the brass.\nThe brass’s orders are absolute.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ヘイチョーと　呼ばれる　１匹と\nヘイと　呼ばれる　５匹で　ひとつ。\nヘイチョーの　命令は　絶対。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "列阵兵由１个头头\n和５个跟班组成。\n头头的命令不可违抗。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Este Pokémon consta de cinco subalternos y un\nlíder, cuyas órdenes obedecen sin rechistar.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "６ぴきで　１ぴきの　ポケモン。\nたいれつを　くみかえながら\nチームワークで　たたかうのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "6마리가 1마리의 포켓몬이다.\n대열을 바꿔가며\n팀워크로 싸운다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "６隻為一體的寶可夢。\n慣於團隊行動，會一邊\n變換陣形一邊戰鬥。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "À six, ils représentent un Pokémon unique.\nIls peuvent changer de formation et comptent\nsur leur travail d’équipe en combat.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sie bilden zu sechst ein Pokémon. Es kann im\nKampf seine Formation nach Belieben ändern\nund legt bemerkenswerte Teamarbeit an den Tag.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Este Pokémon está formado por seis individuos\nque cambian de formación al luchar, haciendo\ngala de un notable espíritu de equipo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Pokémon dallo spiccato spirito di squadra, è\nformato da 6 elementi che lottano assieme\ncambiando schieramento in base alla situazione.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The six of them work together as one Pokémon.\nTeamwork is also their battle strategy, and they\nconstantly change their formation as they fight.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "６匹で　１匹の　ポケモン。\n隊列を　組み替えながら\nチームワークで　戦うのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "６只为一体的宝可梦。\n惯于团队行动，会一边\n变换阵形一边战斗。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Este Pokémon está formado por seis individuos\nque cambian de formación al luchar, haciendo\ngala de un notable espíritu de equipo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "せんとうに　たって　しじを　だすヘイチョーは　６ぴきの　なかでいちばん　つよくて　かしこいのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "선두에 서서 지시를 내리는 리더는 6마리 중에서 가장 강하고 똑똑하다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "站在最前面下達指示的頭頭是６隻裡面最強最聰明的。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le chef se situe en tête et donne des ordres aux autres. C’est le plus fort et le plus intelligent des six.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Der Anführer steht an erster Stelle und gibt die Befehle. Er ist das stärkste und schlauste Glied dieses sechsteiligen Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "El líder, que es el más fuerte e inteligente de los seis, se encuentra al frente y da órdenes a los demás.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "L’elemento che sta davanti e che dà ordini al gruppo è il più forte e intelligente tra i sei.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The brass, which is the one that stands at the front and issues orders, is the strongest and smartest of the six.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "先頭に　立って　指示を　出すヘイチョーは　６匹の　中でいちばん　強くて　賢いのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "站在最前方下达指令的头头是６只里边最强最聪明的。",
